<title>INDIA: No trade in Indian call money, gilts inactive.</title>
<headline>No trade in Indian call money, gilts inactive.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1996-12-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>No trades were reported in Indian call money on Tuesday as there were no clearing operations, dealers said.</p>
<p>They said there was no interbank clearing as the Reserve Bank of India was not open for customer transactions on account of its half-yearly closing of accounts.</p>
<p>Dealers said the government securities market was also inactive with a few stray deals reported in treasury bills.</p>
<p>-- Bombay newsroom +91-22-265 9000</p>
</text>
